This project reuses the QQ platform adapter and runtime types from
Hermes Agent by Nous Research, licensed under the MIT License.
The adapter snapshot is vendor/hermes_qq_adapter.py; its upstream license is
preserved in vendor/HERMES_LICENSE.
Upstream: https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent

The runtime image is pinned by digest. It supplies QQ SDK dependencies only;
the project's entrypoint does not launch Hermes Gateway, AIAgent, cron, or an LLM.
tmux and Docker are external dependencies and retain their own licenses.

The static product guide bundles Lucide 1.53.0 icons, distributed under the
ISC license with MIT-licensed Feather-derived icons. The complete notice is
preserved in site/assets/LUCIDE_LICENSE.
